/px4_runs

# Ground-truth SITL run archives (ulogs + telemetry), same class as /px4_runs.
# Matched at any depth: these get written both at the repo root and next to
# the tuning scripts that produced them.
stage3_gt_runs/

# Working state for the PX4 gain search: GA-derived candidate sets and the
# per-candidate flight results. Regenerable from a genetic_archive.csv via
# ga_to_candidates.py, so they are outputs, not inputs.
# Matched at any depth rather than by full path: pinning it to
# examples/px4_tuning/ meant the rule silently stopped matching the day the
# folder moved under examples/tools/, and three working files were committed.
**/px4_tuning/*.json
